WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.457 --> 00:00:15.718
Henry rushed over to the tree house window.

2
00:00:16.698 --> 00:00:17.559
Cole was right!

3
00:00:18.459 --> 00:00:20.760
Nora was tiptoeing across the backyard.

4
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.142
She stopped every few steps and stared around in every direction.

5
00:00:25.162 --> 00:00:27.903
"Shh!" he warned the others.

6
00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:30.464
"Don't let her hear us up here!"

7
00:00:31.444 --> 00:00:34.285
Nora didn't look up as she passed beneath the tree house.

8
00:00:35.385 --> 00:00:39.126
She turned left and hurried toward the picket fence at the side of the yard.

9
00:00:39.146 --> 00:00:42.147
"Where's she going?"

10
00:00:42.527 --> 00:00:43.307
Maggie whispered.

11
00:00:44.288 --> 00:00:46.428
Nora reached the fence and stepped over it.

12
00:00:47.468 --> 00:00:48.669
Then she kept walking.

13
00:00:48.689 --> 00:00:53.210
"It looks like she's cutting across the Smiths' yard," Nathan said.

14
00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:55.090
"Let's follow her!"

15
00:00:57.731 --> 00:01:00.592
They all climbed down from the tree house as fast as they could.

16
00:01:03.072 --> 00:01:05.313
Henry led the way as they hurried after Nora.

17
00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:08.194
"Will your neighbors mind that we're in their yard?"

18
00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.875
Cole asked Nathan as he hopped over the fence.

19
00:01:11.996 --> 00:01:12.996
Nathan shook his head.

20
00:01:13.016 --> 00:01:14.997
"They're really nice.

21
00:01:16.058 --> 00:01:18.319
They said we can play over here anytime we want."

22
00:01:19.399 --> 00:01:20.720
Henry was glad to hear that.

23
00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:25.021
But he was more focused on keeping Nora in sight.

24
00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:28.943
"She's heading for the woods," he whispered to his friends.

25
00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:30.564
"Let's go!"

26
00:01:32.928 --> 00:01:34.488
They raced to the edge of the forest.

27
00:01:35.489 --> 00:01:37.529
There was a trail just inside the tree line.

28
00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:42.031
Henry and his friends followed the trail as quietly as they could.

29
00:01:42.051 --> 00:01:46.132
"Do you see her?"

30
00:01:46.652 --> 00:01:47.952
Maggie asked quietly.

31
00:01:47.972 --> 00:01:49.573
"Not yet.

32
00:01:50.573 --> 00:01:52.894
Let's stop and listen," Henry whispered.

33
00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:56.154
They all stopped and listened for a few seconds.

34
00:01:57.135 --> 00:01:58.815
There were a lot of sounds in the woods.

35
00:01:59.815 --> 00:02:01.656
Birds chirped in the branches overhead.

36
00:02:02.972 --> 00:02:06.855
A squirrel rustled against pine needles as it scampered up a pine tree.

37
00:02:07.816 --> 00:02:09.938
Bees buzzed around looking for flowers.

38
00:02:11.579 --> 00:02:16.443
Then Henry heard something else: the crack of a twig somewhere deeper in the forest!

39
00:02:16.463 --> 00:02:18.265
"Did you hear that?"

40
00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:19.346
he whispered.

41
00:02:20.327 --> 00:02:21.227
The others nodded.

42
00:02:22.468 --> 00:02:25.651
Henry spotted a smaller trail that turned off the main one.

43
00:02:27.152 --> 00:02:31.276
Following the new trail, he walked toward the spot where he'd heard the cracking sound.

44
00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.801
His friends were right behind him.

45
00:02:34.841 --> 00:02:37.562
Then they all heard another sound: Thump!

46
00:02:37.582 --> 00:02:39.243
"What was that?"

47
00:02:39.683 --> 00:02:40.484
Maggie whispered.

48
00:02:41.504 --> 00:02:42.564
Henry didn't answer.

49
00:02:43.585 --> 00:02:45.326
He was already running toward the sound.

50
00:02:46.346 --> 00:02:47.367
It had to be Nora!

51
00:02:48.907 --> 00:02:50.948
He burst out into a small clearing.

52
00:02:51.788 --> 00:02:54.169
There was an old toolshed in the middle of it.

53
00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:59.172
Its rickety door was open—that was what had caused the thumping sound.

54
00:03:00.284 --> 00:03:03.086
Standing in the doorway, with her back to them, was Nora!

55
00:03:03.106 --> 00:03:04.847
"She's here!"

56
00:03:05.247 --> 00:03:05.928
Henry cried.

57
00:03:05.948 --> 00:03:10.131
"Eek!" Nora spun around and let out a squeak of fright.

58
00:03:11.432 --> 00:03:13.073
"What are you doing here?"

59
00:03:13.093 --> 00:03:15.234
"We were following you."

60
00:03:16.335 --> 00:03:19.717
Henry walked toward her, glad that she wasn't running away this time.

61
00:03:19.737 --> 00:03:22.599
"What are you doing out here?"

62
00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.041
"None of your business," Nora said.

63
00:03:27.082 --> 00:03:29.684
Maggie, Cole, and Nathan rushed into the clearing.

64
00:03:30.732 --> 00:03:31.533
"There she is!"

65
00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:32.954
Maggie exclaimed.

66
00:03:32.974 --> 00:03:37.497
"You guys should stop sneaking around like that!"

67
00:03:37.637 --> 00:03:38.678
Nora cried loudly.

68
00:03:38.698 --> 00:03:40.700
"You scared me!

69
00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:44.162
I had no idea you were following me!"

70
00:03:44.903 --> 00:03:45.884
Henry stared at her.

71
00:03:45.904 --> 00:03:49.086
"Why isn't she trying to run away?"

72
00:03:49.566 --> 00:03:50.167
he wondered.

73
00:03:51.288 --> 00:03:53.709
Last night she'd seemed desperate to get away from them.

74
00:03:53.729 --> 00:03:55.831
"What's going on?"

75
00:03:56.231 --> 00:03:56.832
he demanded.

76
00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.462
"Are you really surprised to see us, or are you faking?"

77
00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:04.163
"What are you talking about, Henry?"

78
00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:05.704
Maggie pushed past him.

79
00:04:05.724 --> 00:04:08.466
"Let's see what's in that shed."

80
00:04:12.528 --> 00:04:14.829
Henry was still watching Nora suspiciously.

81
00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.811
But he was curious about the shed too.

82
00:04:18.931 --> 00:04:20.392
He followed the others inside.

83
00:04:20.412 --> 00:04:24.034
"Aha!" Nathan pointed to something in the corner.

84
00:04:24.054 --> 00:04:27.036
"That explains everything!"

85
00:04:28.188 --> 00:04:29.548
It was dark inside the shed.

86
00:04:30.669 --> 00:04:33.630
Henry had to lean forward to see what Nathan was pointing at.

87
00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:35.790
"Soda cans?"

88
00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:37.851
he said when he got a good look.

89
00:04:37.871 --> 00:04:39.771
"I don't get it."

90
00:04:40.891 --> 00:04:44.753
"Nora isn't allowed to drink soda," Nathan explained as he picked up a can.

91
00:04:45.893 --> 00:04:48.073
"She must have been sneaking out here to drink it."

92
00:04:49.654 --> 00:04:50.454
Cole laughed.

93
00:04:50.474 --> 00:04:53.475
"I'm not allowed to drink soda either.

94
00:04:54.495 --> 00:04:57.156
But I never thought of sneaking into the woods to drink it!"

95
00:04:58.252 --> 00:05:00.094
Henry opened the shed door wider.

96
00:05:01.195 --> 00:05:03.497
That let in more light so it was easier to see.

97
00:05:04.638 --> 00:05:07.621
He counted three more empty soda cans lying in the corner.

98
00:05:07.641 --> 00:05:10.844
"Please don't tell Mom and Dad!"

99
00:05:11.124 --> 00:05:12.245
Nora begged Nathan.

100
00:05:12.265 --> 00:05:15.168
"I'll be in big trouble!"

101
00:05:16.068 --> 00:05:16.889
Nathan sighed.

102
00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:18.371
"All right.

103
00:05:19.472 --> 00:05:21.734
But only if you promise not to do it anymore."

104
00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:23.896
Nora crossed her heart.

105
00:05:24.948 --> 00:05:28.989
"I promise I won't sneak out here to drink soda anymore," she said.

106
00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:33.070
Then she dashed out of the shed and disappeared into the woods.

107
00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:36.131
"Case closed!"

108
00:05:36.511 --> 00:05:37.172
Cole grinned.

109
00:05:37.192 --> 00:05:42.233
"It looks like The Lemonade Detectives solved another tough mystery!"

110
00:05:42.253 --> 00:05:43.974
"That's right."

111
00:05:45.034 --> 00:05:47.374
Nathan pulled a five-dollar bill out of his pocket.

112
00:05:48.475 --> 00:05:49.355
"Here's your payment.

113
00:05:50.395 --> 00:05:52.456
Thanks!" "Wait."

114
00:05:53.344 --> 00:05:56.369
Henry stepped forward and stopped Maggie from taking the money.

115
00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:58.873
"What's the matter this time?"

116
00:05:59.233 --> 00:05:59.874
Maggie said.

117
00:05:59.894 --> 00:06:04.722
"Keep your money for now, Nathan," Henry said with a frown.

118
00:06:05.823 --> 00:06:08.447
"Because I don't think we've really solved your case."
